# Local-only scratch that must never be uploaded by a CLI `vercel deploy`.
# Irrelevant to git-based deploys (Vercel clones the repo, so untracked files
# are absent anyway) but without this a CLI deploy from this working copy
# uploads ~260MB of virtualenvs, audit screenshots, and design source files.

node_modules
build
dist

# Playwright / design-review tooling
.pw-venv
.playwright-mcp
.pw-*.py

# Audit + report artifacts
design-audit-*
seo-reports
reports

# Design sources
*.fig
*.make
GCWebsite-main

# Local notes and captures.
# NOTE: only ROOT-level .png is excluded (leading slash). A bare `*.png` rule
# also drops src/assets/gc-logo-transparent.png and src/imports/favicon.png,
# which scripts/seo/generate-icons.mjs reads during prebuild — that fails the
# build with "Input file is missing".
activities.md
activities.md.bak
md.md
/*.png
docs/superpowers
